# SARA evaluator API

This file is the evaluator-facing contract. The required scope and output below
are fixed. The factual input contract is also fixed for the Prolog-derived
Catala tests; add internal variables and section subscopes without renaming or
removing these declarations.

- Requirement ID `SARA-TOTAL-TAX`: scope `TotalTax`, output `total_tax`.

> Module Api
> Using Definitions as W
> Using Section1 as S1
> Using Section2 as S2
> Using Section63 as S63
> Using Section68 as S68
> Using Section151 as S151
> Using Section152 as S152
> Using Section3301 as S3301
> Using Section3306 as S3306
> Using Section7703 as S7703

```catala-metadata
declaration scope TotalTax:
  input world content W.World
  input taxpayer content W.Entity
  input period content W.TaxPeriod
  # Add internal variables and section subscopes here.
  # Keep the predeclared output below unchanged.
  output total_tax content money
```

```catala
# Define TotalTax.total_tax by composing the statutory section scopes. Keep
